		<defName>RK_Hoodie</defName>
		<label>ratkin hoodie</label>
		<description>Ratkin is often used as a type of hooded clothing for home pajamas. The material is soft and comfortable, and also provides good insulation. There is a hole on the back of the hood for conveniently placing Ratkin's ears.</description>
